- {"self_ref":"\#/texts/74","parent":{"$ref":"\#/texts/51"},"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"paragraph","prov":[],"orig":"In each case, separate graphs of % toxic effect against log₁₀ concentration of ZnSO₄ were plotted on the same axes for each value of time (minutes) after addition of Zeocin™ or water. The sensitivities of the various reagents, expressed as an EC₅₀ value for 15 minutes exposed to ZnSO₄, are summarised in Table 1 below.","text":"In each case, separate graphs of % toxic effect against log₁₀ concentration of ZnSO₄ were plotted on the same axes for each value of time (minutes) after addition of Zeocin™ or water. The sensitivities of the various reagents, expressed as an EC₅₀ value for 15 minutes exposed to ZnSO₄, are summarised in Table 1 below."}
